        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>高中化学：90+逆袭计划</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };\n  </script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      background: #edf0f3;\n      font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", serif;\n      color: #1d1d1b;\n    }\n    .page {\n      width: 540px;\n      min-height: 720px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      background: #fbfbed;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n    .appbar {\n      height: 31px;\n      background: #4b6280;\n      color: #f7f8fa;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      padding: 0 12px;\n      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n      font-size: 13px;\n    }\n    .appbar .left, .appbar .right {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 15px;\n      width: 125px;\n      color: #e4eaf2;\n      font-size: 18px;\n    }\n    .appbar .right {\n      justify-content: flex-end;\n      gap: 14px;\n    }\n    .appbar .title {\n      flex: 1;\n      text-align: center;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n      font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .toolbar {\n      height: 31px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #c8cbca;\n      background: #fafafa;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      padding: 0 20px;\n      gap: 17px;\n      color: #505a5d;\n      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n      font-size: 18px;\n    }\n    .tool { white-space: nowrap; }\n    .pen {\n      color: #4f687c;\n      transform: rotate(-35deg);\n      font-size: 21px;\n    }\n    .marker {\n      color: #c7d83c;\n      text-shadow: 1px 1px #71891c;\n      transform: rotate(-30deg);\n      font-size: 22px;\n    }\n    .colors { margin-left: auto; display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center; }\n    .dot { width: 15px; height: 15px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; }\n    .paper {\n      min-height: 658px;\n      padding: 8px 13px 18px 19px;\n      background-color: #fcfdf0;\n      background-image:\n        linear-gradient(rgba(167, 186, 173, .28) 1px, transparent 1px),\n        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(167, 186, 173, .28) 1px, transparent 1px);\n      background-size: 12px 12px;\n      font-size: 15px;\n      line-height: 1.36;\n      letter-spacing: .2px;\n    }\n    .line { min-height: 20px; white-space: nowrap; position: relative; }\n    .n { display: inline-block; width: 28px; }\n    .red {\n      text-decoration: underline;\n      text-decoration-color: #c9473c;\n      text-decoration-thickness: 2px;\n      text-underline-offset: 2px;\n    }\n    .circle {\n      display: inline-block;\n      border: 2px solid #c83f34;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      padding: 0 3px;\n      line-height: 1.05;\n      transform: rotate(-7deg);\n    }\n    .yellow {\n      background: linear-gradient(transparent 38%, rgba(242, 224, 42, .76) 38%, rgba(242, 224, 42, .76) 88%, transparent 88%);\n    }\n    .formula {\n      font-family: \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n      font-weight: 500;\n      letter-spacing: .4px;\n    }\n    .indent { padding-left: 10px; }\n    .small { font-size: 14px; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"page\">\n    <div class=\"appbar\">\n      <div class=\"left\"><span>‹</span><span>⌘</span><span>⌕</span><span>⇧</span><span>♩</span><span>▥</span></div>\n      <div class=\"title\">高中化学：90+逆袭计划⌄</div>\n      <div class=\"right\"><span>↶</span><span>↷</span><span>♧</span><span>▣</span><span>×</span><span>•••</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"toolbar\">\n      <span class=\"tool\">▧</span><span class=\"tool pen\">／</span><span class=\"tool\">◇</span><span class=\"tool marker\">▰</span>\n      <span class=\"tool\">♧</span><span class=\"tool\">◌</span><span class=\"tool\">✪</span><span class=\"tool\">▧</span><span class=\"tool\">T</span><span class=\"tool\">◇</span>\n      <span class=\"colors\"><i class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#414141\"></i><i class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#626262\"></i><i class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#ed7063\"></i><i class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#f5ba8b\"></i><i class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#ece95d\"></i><i class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#b9dded\"></i></span>\n    </div>\n\n    <main class=\"paper\">\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"n\">31、</span>磷与氧气反应，氧气充足生成五氧化二磷，氧气<span class=\"circle\">不足</span>生成三氧化二磷。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"n\">32、</span>白磷<span class=\"red\">易</span>燃为P4，分子晶体，故12.4g白磷含有磷原子数目为0.4NA。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"n\">33、</span><span class=\"formula\">Cl<sub>2</sub></span>与<span class=\"yellow\">足量</span>Fe反应，先形成<span class=\"yellow\">过量</span>Fe<span class=\"circle\">不</span>过量，少量硫酸亚铁，又有溶液中</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">铁才与氯气继续反应生成<span class=\"yellow\">三</span>氯化铁。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"n\">34、</span><span class=\"formula\">Al<sub>2</sub>3 + 3AlO<sub>2</sub><sup>-</sup> + 6H<sub>2</sub>O = 4Al(OH)<sub>3</sub>↓</span></div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"n\">35、</span>注意二氧化硅通入水<span class=\"red\">不</span>接触水反应：</div>\n      <div class=\"line indent\"><span class=\"formula\">2H2O+2CO2+Na2SiO3=2NaHCO3+H2SiO3↓</span>；二氧化碳<span class=\"circle\">不</span>过量生成碳酸钠</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"n\">36、</span>比较半径大小：</div>\n      <div class=\"line indent\">（1）同周期，原子半径小</div>\n      <div class=\"line indent\">（2）<span class=\"yellow\">同种，原子半径大</span></div>\n      <div class=\"line indent\">（3）核间，阴离子半径小，例如铁大于二价铁<span class=\"circle\">大于</span>三价铁</div>\n      <div class=\"line indent\">（4）电子层结构相同，核电荷数越大，半径越小</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"n\">37、</span><span class=\"red\">C是</span>形成化合物最多的元素，单质是自然界中硬度<span class=\"circle\">最</span>大的物质元素或气态</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">氢化物中氢的质量分数最高元素。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"n\">38、</span>元素与<span class=\"yellow\">O2</span>反应，化合反应；卤的氧化物常温下反应生成浓硫酸<span class=\"circle\">单</span>质的是S。这</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">是高价和重要<span class=\"red\">氧化</span>物反应，也是<span class=\"circle\">二</span>硫化碳具有氧化性的反应。</div>\n      <div class=\"line indent\"><span class=\"formula\">2H2S+SO2=2H2O+3S</span></div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"n\">39、</span>元素都与氢气反应却只<span class=\"yellow\">同</span>离子的物质对面的水化物的酸反应生成盐的元</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">素为N。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"n\">40、</span>单质在高温下<span class=\"red\">与浓硫酸</span>反应非金属元素为Br。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">单质在<span class=\"yellow\">常温下</span>全液态非金属元素为：Hg。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"n\">41、</span>合金是混合物，<span class=\"red\">惰能</span>通过蒸馏于其成分间金属，比如：硬度比它的各组分</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">金属硬，合金熔点比它的各组分低。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"n\">42、</span><span class=\"formula\">3Mg+N2=Mg3N2</span>；<span class=\"formula\">2Mg+CO2=C+2MgO</span>（条件都是点燃，别忘记</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">哦，花物质间<span class=\"circle\">C</span>会出，如果认为镁与氧气反应燃烧是错误哦）</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"n\">43、</span>盐块、普通钠、不锈钢气泡里胶溶解，生铁：生铁是含碳量大于2%的</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">铁碳合金，钢：钢是含碳量在0.04%～2.3%之间的铁碳合金，不锈钢是Fe、</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">C、Cr合金，Fe含量大约为74.6%。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"n\">44、</span>氯碱工业原理：利用水膜隔膜，原理是阴阳花水中可以<span class=\"red\">通电</span>出两种金</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">属离子：<span class=\"formula\">KAl(SO4)2 = K+ + Al3+ + 2SO4<sup>2-</sup></span>；而Al3+被<span class=\"yellow\">沉</span>水解，生成胶</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">状的氢氧化铝<span class=\"formula\">Al(OH)3：Al3+ + 3H2O = Al(OH)3</span>（胶体）+ 3H+ 氢氧化铝</div>\n    </main>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
